01:05:43.747 --> 01:05:45.738
One thing I can guarantee you Dom.


01:05:46.116 --> 01:05:48.108
No one's ready for this.


01:05:48.153 --> 01:05:50.183
I want every with
chip with the GEODIE exploits


01:05:50.214 --> 01:05:52.785
in a two mile radius
around that motorcade now.


01:05:52.824 --> 01:05:54.145
There's over a thousands of them.


01:05:54.325 --> 01:05:55.890
Hack 'em all.


01:06:13.078 --> 01:06:14.243
It's zombie time.


01:06:22.588 --> 01:06:24.413
I'd buckle up if I were you.


01:06:25.019 --> 01:06:25.859
<i>AUTO-DRIVE ACTIVATED.</i>


01:07:26.889 --> 01:07:27.547
<i>Hey..!</i>


01:07:36.365 --> 01:07:38.133
Target the motorcade.


01:07:48.277 --> 01:07:50.141
And here they come.


01:07:55.018 --> 01:07:56.110
<i>What is going on?</i>


01:07:57.420 --> 01:07:58.951
Ouch.


01:08:01.349 --> 01:08:02.352
<i>Drive fast!</i>


01:08:07.998 --> 01:08:09.017
Police escort down..


01:08:09.634 --> 01:08:12.061
Take out the lead and follow cars.


01:08:27.732 --> 01:08:29.008
<i>Drive! Drive!</i>


01:08:38.664 --> 01:08:40.856
- Two more down.
- Still a new warranty.


01:08:41.056 --> 01:08:44.004
<i>There's more cars ahead of us.
Shoot their engines.</i>


01:08:52.220 --> 01:08:53.100
<i>Oh God!</i>


01:09:06.960 --> 01:09:09.019
<i>We got an army of cars
driving themselves.</i>


01:09:09.062 --> 01:09:10.379
<i>Send backup! Send S.W.A.T!</i>


01:09:10.449 --> 01:09:12.474
<i>I don't care if you send the
goddamn boy scout...</i>


01:09:12.664 --> 01:09:15.867
<i>- Just send up some help!</i>
- Now that's Dom.


01:09:21.037 --> 01:09:22.368
<i>Faster, faster!</i>


01:09:44.066 --> 01:09:45.966
The motorcade just turned on 7th.


01:09:46.001 --> 01:09:48.060
Perfect. Make it rain.


01:10:46.031 --> 01:10:47.896
Target immobilized.


01:10:48.401 --> 01:10:50.027
You are up Dom.


01:11:04.392 --> 01:11:07.182
<i>- Who the hell is that?
- What is he doing?</i>


01:11:10.494 --> 01:11:11.911
<i>What the hell
are you waiting for?</i>


01:11:12.061 --> 01:11:13.301
<i>Shoot him!</i>


01:11:13.746 --> 01:11:15.641
<i>Come on, come on!</i>


01:11:24.192 --> 01:11:25.373
<i>I'm out.</i>


01:11:27.879 --> 01:11:28.203
<i>Shit.</i>


01:11:28.273 --> 01:11:30.649
<i>Don't worry sir.
This car is bulletproof.</i>


01:11:30.928 --> 01:11:32.508
<i>You'll be safe in here.</i>


01:11:36.516 --> 01:11:38.418
<i>- Give me the case.
- Give him the case.</i>


01:11:38.537 --> 01:11:42.622
<i>These are nuclear launch codes.
We cannot give it to him.</i>


01:11:47.816 --> 01:11:49.253
<i>What is he doing now?</i>


01:12:06.122 --> 01:12:08.337
<i>He just cut a hole
in our gas tank.</i>


01:12:35.078 --> 01:12:37.279
Good work, Dom.


01:12:37.481 --> 01:12:38.724
Meet you at the pick-up.


01:12:49.256 --> 01:12:50.998
I think I know
where my team's at.


01:12:51.395 --> 01:12:54.330
- Where?
- Right in front of me.


01:13:05.977 --> 01:13:09.377
This is on you.
Get out of there, Dom.


01:13:09.414 --> 01:13:10.916
Guys, I know why Dom's here.


01:13:11.418 --> 01:13:14.104
Police scanners are saying
he's stolen Nuclear Football.


01:13:17.357 --> 01:13:20.684
It's over, Toretto.
Get your ass out of the car now.


01:13:27.700 --> 01:13:28.940
That's how you wanna play this?


01:13:29.702 --> 01:13:30.770
Let's play.


01:13:37.111 --> 01:13:38.636
Don't do this, Dom.


01:13:44.218 --> 01:13:45.748
- What're you doing?
- It's a trap!


01:14:10.879 --> 01:14:13.443
Now I know what it feels like
be every cop ever chasing us.


01:14:13.530 --> 01:14:15.034
I'm gonna get a
little close and I ped him.


01:14:15.104 --> 01:14:16.651
Oh, so you just gonna take Dom?


01:14:17.253 --> 01:14:20.521
Little Nobody has clearly
lost his little mind.


01:14:33.170 --> 01:14:33.928
I'm on him.


01:14:33.971 --> 01:14:35.871
Easy, work together.


01:14:44.481 --> 01:14:46.351
<i>- Look out!</i>
- Wait, wait, wait!


01:14:48.251 --> 01:14:49.051
Oh shit.


01:14:55.860 --> 01:14:57.248
I will take the short cut.


01:15:10.475 --> 01:15:11.985
Look out!
Watch these people.


01:15:13.243 --> 01:15:14.917
Big Sexy coming through!


01:15:44.444 --> 01:15:45.824
Not this time, Dom.


01:16:44.941 --> 01:16:46.840
Stretch him out.
Hold them.


01:17:14.972 --> 01:17:17.041
He gotta have about
2000 Horse Power in that thing.


01:17:17.675 --> 01:17:18.940
Try 3000..


01:17:22.780 --> 01:17:24.014
Try Five.


01:17:32.275 --> 01:17:33.437
Get out of there.


01:17:33.637 --> 01:17:34.559
I'm working on it.


01:17:34.694 --> 01:17:36.856
Stop working on it, and do it..


01:17:48.908 --> 01:17:51.077
No, no no...
It's my Bentley.


01:18:01.654 --> 01:18:02.401
No!


01:18:30.652 --> 01:18:33.644
Get that case and run!


01:18:45.234 --> 01:18:46.560
Move!


01:18:52.075 --> 01:18:54.134
They thought...
this was gonna be a streetfight.


01:18:54.234 --> 01:18:55.333
You wait for it..


01:18:59.081 --> 01:18:59.899
No!


01:19:12.696 --> 01:19:14.596
Letty, stop!


01:19:18.736 --> 01:19:20.664
What are you gonna do?


01:19:33.218 --> 01:19:37.682
I don't know why you're doing this,
but I know one thing.


01:19:38.556 --> 01:19:40.524
You love me.


01:19:44.296 --> 01:19:46.691
And you're not gonna to shoot me.


01:19:57.644 --> 01:20:01.306
You should've given him the case,
cause I won't chase you.


01:20:03.250 --> 01:20:04.676
Okay.


01:20:05.025 --> 01:20:07.250
I will just take it
from a dead girl.


01:20:09.622 --> 01:20:11.123
You willing to die for it?


01:20:29.676 --> 01:20:31.241
Let's go then.


01:20:52.417 --> 01:20:53.880
Anything?


01:20:54.119 --> 01:20:55.950
They're gone.


01:20:56.821 --> 01:20:59.280
And D.O.D confirmed
it was a nuclear football.


01:20:59.524 --> 01:21:02.984
He's got an EMP and
nuclear launch codes.


01:21:03.027 --> 01:21:04.509
I don't know what it is,


01:21:04.579 --> 01:21:06.985
but they're building
towards something.


01:21:07.030 --> 01:21:08.895
Deckard?


01:21:09.967 --> 01:21:10.884
He didn't make it.


01:21:32.420 --> 01:21:34.128
I'm disappointed in you, Dom.


01:21:36.052 --> 01:21:38.913
You're gonna Letty just walk
away with the codes.


01:21:38.925 --> 01:21:41.894
- You've got the codes!
- Rhodes got the codes.


01:21:41.928 --> 01:21:44.954
You made the choice
to let her go.


01:21:46.031 --> 01:21:48.090
And now I have to make
one on my own.


01:22:00.044 --> 01:22:04.312
They are adorable little things,
aren't they?


01:22:04.748 --> 01:22:06.407
I hope I don't hurt him.


01:22:11.020 --> 01:22:14.320
Look, Cipher, I did exactly
what you asked me to do.


01:22:14.890 --> 01:22:16.003
Don't do this.


01:22:16.203 --> 01:22:19.425
- This is your doing.
- My doing?


01:22:28.702 --> 01:22:30.427
Please don't hurt him.
I'm begging you.


01:22:30.738 --> 01:22:33.236
I don't want you to beg.


01:22:35.642 --> 01:22:38.839
- I want you to learn.
- Learn what?


01:22:39.779 --> 01:22:44.738
I understand why you did
what you did. I really do.


01:22:50.255 --> 01:22:51.822
But it was the wrong choice.


01:22:53.123 --> 01:22:55.792
This is a consequence, Dom.


01:22:57.194 --> 01:22:59.728
No! No! No...


01:23:00.763 --> 01:23:02.690
Wait. Wait.


01:23:04.701 --> 01:23:06.692
No!


01:23:33.225 --> 01:23:36.591
Can you pull up the footage
from the guy in the ally.


01:23:36.629 --> 01:23:38.824
- Traffic cams.
- I got you.


01:23:43.201 --> 01:23:46.703
I knew it.
I recognize that guy.


01:23:46.771 --> 01:23:48.235
That's Connor Rhodes.


01:23:48.305 --> 01:23:50.500
I met him when I was working
with Shaw's brother.


01:23:51.441 --> 01:23:53.442
He wanted us to get the
Nightshade device him.


01:23:54.177 --> 01:23:55.308
Connor Rhodes.


01:23:56.078 --> 01:23:58.945
He's also linked to somebody
who I like to forget.


01:23:58.981 --> 01:24:00.141
Mose Jakande.


01:24:00.983 --> 01:24:03.008
Warlord who tried to get God's eye.


01:24:03.019 --> 01:24:06.352
Which means that's twice that
Dom has messed up Cipher's business.


01:24:19.133 --> 01:24:20.987
Everything you're feeling right now,


01:24:21.000 --> 01:24:25.002
that's rage, sense of loss.
It's not real.


01:24:25.272 --> 01:24:29.163
It's a survival instinct wired
deep into our brains.


01:24:29.364 --> 01:24:32.968
To ensure continuation of species.


01:24:33.078 --> 01:24:35.905
When early men went visit
a watering hole...


01:24:36.914 --> 01:24:42.045
If they didn't watch their child,
they got snatched by a crocodile.


01:24:42.186 --> 01:24:48.991
Their brains would create a painful
but a structural memory.


01:24:49.726 --> 01:24:52.053
So it will never happen again.


01:24:53.896 --> 01:24:57.024
This idea of family
that is so core with you,


01:24:57.032 --> 01:24:59.057
that rules your world...


01:25:00.069 --> 01:25:02.969
It's a biological lie.


01:25:04.005 --> 01:25:06.064
You don't have to accept it.


01:25:08.009 --> 01:25:09.267
I don't!


01:25:12.079 --> 01:25:15.167
Did you really could think
you could destroy two of my teams.


01:25:15.382 --> 01:25:17.110
Without any repercussions?


01:25:18.017 --> 01:25:20.263
I wouldn't have even
looked your way..


01:25:20.333 --> 01:25:21.851
If you hadn't done that.


01:25:21.887 --> 01:25:24.048
You didn't even know you had a kid.


01:25:25.024 --> 01:25:26.414
You can thank me for that.


01:25:26.484 --> 01:25:28.891
And start doing the job
I'm asking you to do.


01:25:28.893 --> 01:25:30.087
Help you start a war.


01:25:30.128 --> 01:25:32.096
Is that what you think I want.


01:25:34.932 --> 01:25:36.991
That's so limited.


01:25:37.968 --> 01:25:40.061
I didn't take that
football to start a war..


01:25:40.104 --> 01:25:43.038
Anymore than I took your son
to start a family.


01:25:43.873 --> 01:25:45.932
Taking your son got me the codes..


01:25:45.975 --> 01:25:47.886
The codes will get me the nukes,


01:25:47.956 --> 01:25:50.343
and the nukes will
get me what I want...


01:25:50.479 --> 01:25:55.111
Today, tomorrow...
and every day after that.


01:25:55.150 --> 01:25:57.015
What's that?


01:25:58.719 --> 01:26:00.853
Accountability.


01:26:02.657 --> 01:26:05.018
The second I fire off
one of those nukes..


01:26:05.025 --> 01:26:07.993
I put the superpowers of this world
on notice that...


01:26:08.027 --> 01:26:10.052
...when they cross the line,


01:26:12.432 --> 01:26:15.931
...I'm gonna be there
to hold the responsible..


01:26:16.869 --> 01:26:18.996
Because the truth is, Dom...


01:26:19.037 --> 01:26:21.096
...To the world out there...


01:26:23.875 --> 01:26:26.935
...I'm the crocodile
at the watering hole.


01:26:32.583 --> 01:26:34.366
You've got one last job to do.


01:26:36.052 --> 01:26:37.952
Cipher..


01:26:47.029 --> 01:26:49.997
If I were you,
I would kiss my son.


01:26:52.066 --> 01:26:55.685
Because whether you value it or not,
all of this...


01:26:56.937 --> 01:26:59.797
Your plane, your security and you...


01:27:01.141 --> 01:27:03.574
...are still on this
earth because of him.


01:27:09.115 --> 01:27:10.676
The problem we have
with tracking Cipher


01:27:10.716 --> 01:27:12.049
is there's nothing to trace then.


01:27:12.050 --> 01:27:13.487
Now we have Rhodes' information.


01:27:13.799 --> 01:27:15.514
And we're getting
snapshots of this data


01:27:15.584 --> 01:27:17.080
before it's scrubbed off the net.


01:27:17.322 --> 01:27:19.693
That looks like somebody's
bank accounts? Always just...


01:27:19.990 --> 01:27:21.819
The Longitude.


01:27:21.926 --> 01:27:24.087
Given the fact that Dom
hit the Russian Motorcade


01:27:24.128 --> 01:27:27.063
safe to say it's Russia.
Go ahead, bring up the map.


01:27:27.732 --> 01:27:29.749
Great, let's start here
run the possibilities.


01:27:30.567 --> 01:27:32.974
Yalta, Poltava.


01:27:33.174 --> 01:27:34.894
Looks like they just threw
letters together.


01:27:35.071 --> 01:27:37.181
- Konyert.
- It's Vladupi.


01:27:37.381 --> 01:27:38.341
What are you doing here?


01:27:39.207 --> 01:27:41.233
Thought I was gonna check in on you
from time to time,


01:27:41.318 --> 01:27:42.333
To see you how you're doing.


01:27:42.403 --> 01:27:44.076
By the way, not so hot.


01:27:44.275 --> 01:27:46.841
But there's nothing in Vladiven.
It's just ice..


01:27:46.941 --> 01:27:47.962
That funny...


01:27:48.450 --> 01:27:50.447
Could've sworn there was a
secret Russian naval base


01:27:50.461 --> 01:27:52.280
with the retrophilic
cold war Submarines.


01:27:52.853 --> 01:27:55.014
Well, technically,
it's not Russian anymore.


01:27:55.400 --> 01:27:58.000
Base was take by a terror grope
of military separatists


01:27:58.049 --> 01:28:00.489
about a month ago. And the
Russians haven't taken it back yet.


01:28:00.494 --> 01:28:03.020
So there is a little
window of opportunity here.


01:28:03.062 --> 01:28:05.224
Russian submarines,
nuclear football,


01:28:05.498 --> 01:28:09.023
it sounds like everything we do
our legs gonna be bombed off.


01:28:09.033 --> 01:28:12.093
Sounds like you're still
a No. 11 on the list.


01:28:12.904 --> 01:28:15.119
It sounds like you've changed
since you look punk ass.


01:28:15.333 --> 01:28:16.661
Facial hairs and camen.


01:28:16.829 --> 01:28:18.612
Guys... guys. Hey.


01:28:18.660 --> 01:28:20.242
We gotta call this in
all the way up the chain.


01:28:20.312 --> 01:28:21.412
That's good thinking champ.


01:28:21.612 --> 01:28:25.274
Except... unfortunately the
Russian Minister of Defense.


01:28:25.482 --> 01:28:28.170
Got himself involved in little
incident on US territory


01:28:28.518 --> 01:28:30.438
and two governments
aren't talking to each other for a while.


01:28:30.453 --> 01:28:32.133
By the time they do...
It will be too late.


01:28:32.292 --> 01:28:33.655
So, any other suggestions?


01:28:34.490 --> 01:28:36.651
Yeah, I got one.


01:28:37.493 --> 01:28:39.461
How about we just
stop them ourselves?


01:28:39.528 --> 01:28:41.586
You're talking about a
Russian Military Base.


01:28:41.629 --> 01:28:42.561
Separatists.


01:28:42.563 --> 01:28:43.935
Whatever. It's suicide.


01:28:44.035 --> 01:28:45.665
It's stopping world war 3.


01:28:47.634 --> 01:28:48.899
What's it gonna be rook?


01:28:48.936 --> 01:28:50.994
You're gonna close your eyes
on this one too?


01:28:51.537 --> 01:28:52.821
Pray that the apocalypse


01:28:52.891 --> 01:28:55.405
doesn't come knocking on
your mama's front door?


01:28:55.408 --> 01:28:57.216
Or are you're gonna saddle up,


01:28:57.285 --> 01:29:00.228
be a man and save the
entire goddamn world.


01:29:06.417 --> 01:29:09.352
You know, thank god
they read it out.


01:29:09.453 --> 01:29:10.420
What's that?


01:29:10.454 --> 01:29:12.414
- Rule number three.
- Which is?


01:29:13.724 --> 01:29:14.815
There are no rules.


01:29:17.327 --> 01:29:18.727
What did I told you, Luke?


01:29:19.195 --> 01:29:20.329
I knew he'd get in three.


01:29:20.829 --> 01:29:21.890
Areal transport leaves in an hour.


01:29:22.165 --> 01:29:23.764
Take whatever vehicle you want.


01:29:23.766 --> 01:29:26.445
- All bets are off.
- All bets are off. Bets are off?


01:29:26.645 --> 01:29:27.833
<i>See you later...</i>


01:29:54.039 --> 01:29:55.961
Letty I don't like telling
you this one thing,


01:29:56.147 --> 01:29:57.713
The game's changed.


01:29:58.074 --> 01:29:59.749
Before we were trying
just to catch Dom,


01:29:59.982 --> 01:30:01.226
but now after all of this...


01:30:01.377 --> 01:30:03.901
I want you to know,
if I have to...


01:30:04.545 --> 01:30:06.878
I'm gonna put him down..


01:30:08.647 --> 01:30:11.847
Then you might have to
take us both down.


01:30:11.916 --> 01:30:14.753
I'm freezing man.
This ain't for me.


01:30:15.618 --> 01:30:17.681
I come from a different
kind of lifestyle brah.


01:30:20.021 --> 01:30:24.012
Ladies know me.
They know where I'm at with.


01:30:24.756 --> 01:30:28.957
I try to take a piss,
I ain't even recognize myself.


01:30:29.192 --> 01:30:31.490
Now that's entirely too
much information.


01:30:31.559 --> 01:30:33.017
I'm just saying.


01:30:33.028 --> 01:30:34.643
Well, one thing is for sure.


01:30:35.430 --> 01:30:37.785
Dom's gotta be either working
with them or making a train


01:30:37.884 --> 01:30:41.389
cause no one will be this insane
to hit this place without a damn army.


01:30:42.333 --> 01:30:43.654
I wouldn't be so sure about that.


01:30:45.935 --> 01:30:46.905
Speak of the Devil.


01:30:54.940 --> 01:30:58.336
Alright, Dom, you're one step
closer to that family reunion.


01:30:58.536 --> 01:30:59.476
400 meters to base.


01:30:59.876 --> 01:31:02.568
Prep the EMP.
Let's take these defenses down.


01:31:14.063 --> 01:31:15.914
<i>We have a possible
threat incoming.</i>


01:31:15.952 --> 01:31:18.697
<i>Raise the barricade,
As soon as possible.</i>


01:31:36.053 --> 01:31:38.465
<i>We've lost power,
get to your positions now.</i>


01:31:40.065 --> 01:31:42.658
Gates are open.
Let's get this party started.


01:31:58.475 --> 01:32:00.075
- EMP's are charging.
- How long?


01:32:00.378 --> 01:32:01.337
60 seconds.


01:32:02.577 --> 01:32:04.770
Alright, Dom,
You've one pulse left in that EMP.


01:32:05.514 --> 01:32:07.540
That sub is heavily insulated.


01:32:07.740 --> 01:32:10.421
You're gonna need to be right
underneath it, for this thing to work.


01:32:34.457 --> 01:32:35.322
Come on.


01:32:35.489 --> 01:32:37.821
<i>Engaging target.
He's beneath the Sub.</i>


01:32:44.079 --> 01:32:46.775
<i>I'm loosing control, mayday, mayday.
I'm going down.</i>


01:32:53.306 --> 01:32:55.379
Yes, two birds with one stone.


01:32:55.579 --> 01:32:56.739
We've got control of the sub.


01:32:56.908 --> 01:32:58.038
Dom, we are good.


01:32:58.776 --> 01:33:00.573
Head over to the Rendezvous.
Ok Matty...


01:33:00.911 --> 01:33:02.635
...Let's take this baby for a spin.


01:33:08.663 --> 01:33:09.512
Damn!


01:33:09.712 --> 01:33:12.980
I think Cipher just rebooted
that Sub's command system.


01:33:13.180 --> 01:33:14.555
What the hell is he talking about?


01:33:14.755 --> 01:33:15.982
In Leyman's terms...


01:33:16.119 --> 01:33:18.211
She just carjacked a submarine.


01:33:19.588 --> 01:33:23.181
We can't let it get away.
There's the control room.


01:33:23.823 --> 01:33:25.263
If you can get me
into that warehouse


01:33:25.592 --> 01:33:27.767
I can tap with network
and counter hack Cipher.


01:33:27.826 --> 01:33:29.185
