01:38:38.833 --> 01:38:40.445
Well, nasty.


01:38:54.108 --> 01:38:55.972
Quite a show.


01:38:58.743 --> 01:39:00.076
Arming the nuke..


01:39:05.082 --> 01:39:07.263
Nuke's going hot,
she's trying to fire this thing.


01:39:07.463 --> 01:39:09.703
