01:40:36.348 --> 01:40:37.671
And disappearing forever.


01:40:39.480 --> 01:40:42.204
I've got the location.
It's 10 miles south west.


01:40:42.704 --> 01:40:45.043
10 miles?
Like I make it in 10 seconds.


01:40:55.949 --> 01:40:58.382
