Take care of it now.


01:46:48.645 --> 01:46:51.794
Jesus Mum, you should
pose to avoid the nerves.


01:46:51.864 --> 01:46:53.272
Oh, shut up, don't be such a baby.


01:46:59.857 --> 01:47:01.592
