01:48:02.239 --> 01:48:04.241
Bloody shit happening.


01:48:04.311 --> 01:48:06.492
You lied about, I mean,
I can't believe you.


01:48:06.528 --> 01:48:09.392
You've gotten upset,
you really upset your mother.


01:48:09.654 --> 01:48:11.045
