- What?


01:51:13.125 --> 01:51:15.153
Hang in there guys!
We're almost through the lock.


01:51:15.661 --> 01:51:18.218
It's easy for you to say,
when your ass ain't on fire.


01:51:23.911 --> 01:51:25.208
Alright little mate.


01:51:25.637 --> 01:51:26.797
It's might be a little scary,


01:51:27.799 --> 01:51:29.265
