- I ain't taking shit.


01:53:29.902 --> 01:53:33.110
- Take the wheel!
- Where are you doing?


01:53:34.558 --> 01:53:36.716
- This is crazy!
- Speed up,


01:53:39.997 --> 01:53:42.022
