01:54:57.767 --> 01:54:59.853
they are gonna reach lock
before the sub does.


01:54:59.953 --> 01:55:01.698
The hell they are.


01:55:04.042 --> 01:55:05.736
Get ready for this.


01:55:25.695 --> 01:55:26.593
Oh shit!


01:55:26.596 --> 01:55:28.587
