untraceable plane.


01:57:02.419 --> 01:57:04.991
You lost the minute
you interrupted my honeymoon.


01:57:07.958 --> 01:57:10.549
Put a heat-seeker on him now.


01:57:12.528 --> 01:57:13.688
Now!


01:57:24.606 --> 01:57:27.097
That's a goddamn heat seeker
coming at us.


01:57:38.118 --> 01:57:41.080
Oh my...
come and get it.


01:58:02.140 --> 01:58:04.117
Guys!
Dive..


01:58:04.343 --> 01:58:08.074
This... This is for my son!


01:58:26.833 --> 01:58:27.875
Dom!


01:59:30.290 --> 01:59:31.668
You are out of bullets Deckard.


01:59:31.825 --> 01:59:35.093
Like I'm need a gun
to take care of you,


01:59:36.195 --> 01:59:37.219
How did you find me?


01:59:39.231 --> 01:59:42.822
You want to see the old Dom?
Watch!


01:59:46.305 --> 01:59:47.956
Resourceful.


01:59:48.341 --> 01:59:50.043
