02:01:04.879 --> 02:01:07.304
I've so much to tell you.


02:01:07.948 --> 02:01:11.025
Yeah you do,
and you can start with that bitch!


02:01:16.122 --> 02:01:20.258
Now, that's...
Dominic Toretto.


02:01:21.427 --> 02:01:25.192
Hey Dom!
I'm just towing it out there?


02:01:25.230 --> 02:01:26.535
We need to get up out of here.


02:01:26.861 --> 02:01:30.108
Cause this all kinda neuclearism
happening under this ice.


02:01:30.369 --> 02:01:33.391
Relax! Without the trigger chips,
those nukes are harmless.


02:01:34.106 --> 02:01:35.364
Ok. So we good then.


02:01:35.841 --> 02:01:38.368
Lemme go and get my
