02:01:41.412 --> 02:01:43.209
Not today.


02:01:46.217 --> 02:01:48.254
We have to get up out of here man.
I'm freezing.


02:02:16.412 --> 02:02:17.541
It's Okay.


02:02:18.314 --> 02:02:19.754
Don't worry,
he's gonna be here soon.


02:02:20.617 --> 02:02:22.551
I get it, y'all got a lot in common.


02:02:22.552 --> 02:02:25.035
Computer hacks,
god's eyes, geeks, nerd.


02:02:25.212 --> 02:02:27.798
..you know, but we got a
lot in common too! Alright?


02:02:27.898 --> 02:02:29.628
- Like what?
- We walk in the room,


02:02:30.024 --> 02:02:31.951
and we are oozing sex appeal.


02:02:32.151 --> 02:02:34.245
Me and you?
There's a problem.


02:02:34.445 --> 02:02:36.523
I am asking the real
question right now.


02:02:37.131 --> 02:02:38.408
Is it gonna be...


02:02:39.501 --> 02:02:43.484
the Nerd or...
the dark knight?


02:02:44.672 --> 02:02:46.537
To be honest
I like both of you.


02:02:46.674 --> 02:02:49.666
A'rigt!
Yeah..yea!


02:02:49.710 --> 02:02:52.433
But just before we
get into all of that,


02:02:52.852 --> 02:02:54.951
Let me ask you one question.


02:02:55.151 --> 02:02:57.674
- You can ask me anything.
- Anything.


02:02:57.984 --> 02:02:59.451
What's my last name?


02:03:01.721 --> 02:03:05.602
When you guys pick around with then
I guess you can let me know.


02:03:05.802 --> 02:03:08.780
It's gonna be a Parker.
That's all that really matters.


02:03:08.803 --> 02:03:09.886
Jones, Miss Parker.


02:03:10.340 --> 02:03:12.001
Hey Miss Parker.


02:03:12.954 --> 02:03:14.418
- Hey.
- Hey.


02:03:15.300 --> 02:03:16.634
I wanted to thank you.


02:03:17.402 --> 02:03:18.098
No need.


02:03:21.156 --> 02:03:22.042
Cipher's still on the loose.


02:03:22.112 --> 02:03:23.441
There's been some
reports she's in Athens.


02:03:23.655 --> 02:03:26.144
But she won't be
nuking any city anytime soon.


02:03:26.344 --> 02:03:27.319
Thanks to you guys.


02:03:27.362 --> 02:03:30.673
- So, I got you a parting favor.
- This can't be good...


02:03:31.199 --> 02:03:35.261
Your record's been clreared.
Full re-instatement. You got you job back.


02:03:35.302 --> 02:03:36.775
That is if you want it.


02:03:40.274 --> 02:03:41.397
If I want?


02:03:49.249 --> 02:03:51.240
You know after 16 years.


02:03:52.218 --> 02:03:53.880
I figured it's time
for a little break.


02:03:53.950 --> 02:03:54.450
Wow.


02:03:56.322 --> 02:03:58.290
Daddy's stayin' home.


02:04:05.197 --> 02:04:07.290
- Nobody.
- Get in touch!


02:04:07.533 --> 02:04:09.293
Ah, hang on a second.


02:04:09.635 --> 02:04:11.295
This could be interesting.


02:04:16.408 --> 02:04:18.327
What made you think
I would do it?


02:04:19.210 --> 02:04:22.445
Brother-hood.
I saw that look you gave Cipher.


02:04:22.545 --> 02:04:24.246
I knew you wanted revenge.


02:04:24.315 --> 02:04:25.503
Glad I did it.


02:04:29.220 --> 02:04:31.134
Can't believe you
went to see my Mother.


02:04:41.231 --> 02:04:42.290
Come on.


02:04:47.236 --> 02:04:48.760
All this fuss of you.


02:04:55.077 --> 02:04:56.237
Yes.


02:05:01.583 --> 02:05:04.287
Alena,
I promise to keep our son safe.


02:05:06.826 --> 02:05:08.435
And now.. he always will be.


02:05:17.231 --> 02:05:19.222
I want to introduce
you to the most


02:05:19.292 --> 02:05:21.114
important person
in my universe.


02:05:22.736 --> 02:05:25.203
Who will never give up on me.


02:05:33.981 --> 02:05:35.140
You've heard me say.


02:05:35.902 --> 02:05:38.210
"That you never turn
your back on family."


02:05:40.152 --> 02:05:44.282
And I wanna thank you all
for never turning your back on me.


02:05:48.828 --> 02:05:50.321
You wanna meet them?


02:05:51.329 --> 02:05:53.194
Alright!


02:05:53.565 --> 02:05:54.506
Everyone...


02:05:56.183 --> 02:05:57.497
Meet Bryan.


02:06:06.611 --> 02:06:07.714
Hey Bryan.


02:06:10.119 --> 02:06:12.308
Okay,
I guess he's my turning secret.


02:06:13.323 --> 02:06:15.139
<i>Thank you for giving us family.</i>


02:06:18.693 --> 02:06:20.199
<i>Thank you for giving us the strength.</i>

